OL,5,AGCSE results day
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe gap between the pass rates for boys
OL,8,Fand girls across all three nations has
OL,9,Fnarrowed again, to its lowest point
OL,10,Fsince 2000
OL,12,FChildhood best friends Jessie and Ellie
OL,13,Fare relieved with their grades and have
OL,14,Fthanked their "amazing teacher, Miss
OL,15,FEvie", while Charlie, who has a rare
OL,16,Fheart condition, has achieved 11 GCSEs
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
