OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATrump vows tougher economic measures on
OL,4,AIran and supporting countries
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after a 60-day ceasefire
OL,7,Fformally expired on Monday without any
OL,8,Fsign of a diplomatic settlement to the
OL,9,Fwar the US and Israel began at the end
OL,10,Fof February. Tehran said Trump's threat
OL,11,Fwould only bring further animosity.
OL,13,FIf realised, it would extend a campaign
OL,14,Fof economic pressure on Iran aimed at
OL,15,Fforcing it into submission.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
